# NUVELO 2: Options                                                            #
#                                                                              #
# TITLE > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <  # TITLE
#                                                                              #
# STATION SELECTION                                                            #
#   Select stations for output file      > %%%%%%%%%%%% <                      # STASEL
#   Stations for velocity computation    > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <              # VELSTA
#                                                                              #
# END_PANEL ####################################################################
